    "detailed_description": "The combat mode is cards, the movement mode is flags, paired with different weapons and armor, and internal skill moves, to defeat the opponent all the way until the final boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition to the main content of battles in 'Why the Jianghu', you can also:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7Mining<br />\r\n\u00b7Find hidden items<br />\r\n\u00b7Making equipment and dishes<br />\r\n\u00b7Release and complete the wanted warrant<br />\r\n\u00b7Remind passersby of goodwill and transactions<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOf course, these are not necessary, but they can help you improve your strength or gain more fun.",
    "about_the_game": "The combat mode is cards, the movement mode is flags, paired with different weapons and armor, and internal skill moves, to defeat the opponent all the way until the final boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition to the main content of battles in 'Why the Jianghu', you can also:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7Mining<br />\r\n\u00b7Find hidden items<br />\r\n\u00b7Making equipment and dishes<br />\r\n\u00b7Release and complete the wanted warrant<br />\r\n\u00b7Remind passersby of goodwill and transactions<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOf course, these are not necessary, but they can help you improve your strength or gain more fun.",
